      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Simply having a few options added that reduce the content loaded would really help fix the memory leaks VRChat has still\n\nespecially the in-game menu has lots of things that just adds up and stay in memory (biggest one being the full detail,full poly avatar 3D preview when scrolling through avatars (these can range from 50-700 MB of RAM being stacked and loaded just by passing it on the list excluding the shaders and particles/dynamic bones/cloth)\n\nVRChat needs to enforce a low detail model to be also uploaded just for the 3D preview in the models (enough auto decimating tools for unity available but not allowed because VRC hates scripts)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
